<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-11-05T11:16:51.491Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 11:16:51 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Salvadoran forces of about 2,000 are searching for four soldiers missing after a gang ambush near Port-au-Prince while denying airstrikes. Haitian gang leaders have written to the United Nations seeking mediation, and one leader said he raised the white flag and warned President Bukele about rising violence. The UN chief condemned a recent attack in Haiti that killed 47 people. The United Nations confirmed 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPeUNkdzBqakZtRzhXWTlKMVVJUEtrTEtNbVZQYTlYN3BRNDVqem1xX292ZHdodVRPOERZLVRSMTFiSTh6WGhEMFc5OXBIdUhEelZRVF9zem82eHUtYlNXclhBNjFqdGpYX011WmlydFNZOUgwVG9Tb2RPUjZWaDNxdlBxa3hpaWh2Y3Nac05FSVg0bkVZRDQ5b1RjUm93cUNMMUExM0tYc2xjVnlBX3ZkX0RFVU5XMVFvSXVF?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxORTJVSzJFM2ctYW9rcGJwdXVqcXYtZEJmVHhRNjZua010OXh2RkhQLW5mSnVQOGg3cjVUNXFyTDV1bm9UbjY5eS1sekFQWXphSDllbG1FYnhLcVhaT0Fjc1g1N2ZDQlREWjh0WFl4bFk4Vm9yeUhxV0RzOGFrOF95eHVKSG9abVFzNUJocGVzOFNCNUozSElVOWUxUnpjb0xUY2U0?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE5aTzNlQ2FQcTlsOUZ0UzZCSDltZUlyZ1YzdDVYZWNsSWpmWjBUZThTbFlsMmFjWGdEeDJrM2tTOV82Y2dYM05rUExlMnpZOXh0SHhMdG1hMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxNcWpBblRQY1dfMzdMb2ZMTmVyZFROc1BqNF9DTXhpVTZsU01FQV9ISnMxaW1yZzJMYzBaeGFUYkhTb2JKTmF3ZXJ1TThFT1BrRVpSVTdTRlFCVkdmTXBNdTl3amM3UTI1MEpkM0lfb3VKYXNzSGFmTmpzZnlKazlPbU1tUkdEWllxMFpkMWl0ZVhDeExrN252NGxMNExFOFhDZ2ZLWHdVRkVxYXpzaDJycnRqSVlSU1hFMjZhSkd6WDBrYkJBMkdOMHI3bjE?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cU